WEBVTT

00:09:59.542 --> 00:10:03.018
as this zero-sum game,
like only one party could win

00:10:03.042 --> 00:10:05.976
and it was kind of like
a duel to the death.

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:07.726
AG: But now, it felt different.

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:11.309
GS: During the negotiation,
it felt really good

00:10:11.333 --> 00:10:15.875
because it really felt like we were
kind of solving this puzzle together.

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:18.559
AG: I love that description

00:10:18.583 --> 00:10:22.309
that good negotiation
is like solving a puzzle together,

00:10:22.333 --> 00:10:24.309
and with her more collaborative approach,

00:10:24.333 --> 00:10:27.059
today Grace doesn't see
herself as a pushover.

00:10:27.083 --> 00:10:30.559
In fact, she negotiates
all kinds of things all the time.